                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 681.63,
                          "height": 128,
                          "content": "I work where product thinking and engineering meet. I stay close to users, communicate directly, document decisions, and carry context from discovery into design and implementation. Since 2011, I’ve built and modernized software across full-stack delivery, performance work, and technical leadership.",
