              "width": 350,
              "height": 38,
              "content": "01 / About",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 32,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H59T8i",
              "name": "About copy",
              "fill": "#f5f7fa",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 350,
              "height": 320,
              "content": "I work where product thinking and engineering meet. I stay close to users, communicate directly, document decisions, and carry context from discovery into design and implementation. Since 2011, I’ve built and modernized software across full-stack delivery, performance work, and technical leadership.\n\nOutside work, I’m usually surfing, learning something new, or finding a better way to make things work.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
